{"schema_version":1,"snapshot":"2021-12-03","source":{"repository":"matthiaskoenig/pkdb_analysis","path":"tests/data/testdata_concise_false.zip","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/matthiaskoenig/pkdb_analysis/develop/tests/data/testdata_concise_false.zip"},"sid":"PKDB00283","namespace":"pkdb","name":"Wang2020b","licence":"closed","access":"public","date":"2020-06-09","creator":"dannythekey","curators":["mkoenig","dannythekey"],"substances":["diazepam","nordazepam"],"identifiers":{"source_study_sid":"PKDB00283","pmid":"31965188","pmcid":null,"doi":null,"pkdb_sid":"PKDB00283"},"reference":{"title":"An Experimental Pharmacokinetics Study of Diazepam and Its Metabolites in Oral Fluid of Chinese Population.","date":"2020-05-18","journal":"Journal of analytical toxicology","authors":["Le-le Wang","Xin-Xin Ren","Yi He","Guan-Feng Cui","Zhi-Wen Wei","Ke-Ming Yun"],"abstract":"Diazepam abuse is widespread all over the word, leading to an increasing number of forensic cases such as suicide, drug-driving and robbery, but relevant studies are limited regarding the extraction of diazepam and its metabolites in oral fluid. This study aimed to investigate the pharmacokinetics of diazepam and its metabolites in oral fluid after a single oral dose in healthy volunteers. There was a total of 28 volunteers, and each ingested 5 mg diazepam orally, then ~2 mL oral fluid were collected from each participant at post-consumption time-points of prior (zero), 1, 2, 4, 8, 12, 24 h and 2, 3, 6, 12 and 15 days, respectively. All samples were extracted with solid-phase extraction and analyzed with high-performance liquid chromatography-tandem mass spectrometry method, and diazepam and nordazepam were detected in the oral fluid of volunteers. Pharmacokinetics of diazepam in oral fluid conformed to a two-compartment model, and k01_HL, k12_HL, k10_HL were 0.7 ± 1.1, 31.4 ± 68.5, 12.1 ± 11.6 h, respectively, nordazepam conformed to an one-compartment model, and k01_HL, k10_HL were 41.5 ± 44.8, 282.3 ± 365.5 h, respectively. Both diazepam and nordazepam could be detected continuously for 15 days, although there were individual differences, and the results regarding diazepam detecting in oral fluid will be of much help in forensic science and drug screening filed."},"row_counts":{"groups":7,"individuals":0,"interventions":1,"outputs":42,"timecourses":2,"scatters":0},"entity_counts":{"groups":1,"individuals":0,"interventions":1,"outputs":42,"timecourses":2,"scatters":0},"groups":[{"study_name":"Wang2020b","measurement_type":"sex","group_count":"28","group_name":"all","max":null,"substance":null,"count":14,"calculation_type":"sample mean","group_parent_pk":null,"sd":null,"unit":null,"se":null,"min":null,"cv":null,"median":null,"group_pk":1304,"characteristica_pk":27424,"mean":null,"choice":"M","value":null},{"study_name":"Wang2020b","measurement_type":"sex","group_count":"28","group_name":"all","max":null,"substance":null,"count":14,"calculation_type":"sample mean","group_parent_pk":null,"sd":null,"unit":null,"se":null,"min":null,"cv":null,"median":null,"group_pk":1304,"characteristica_pk":27425,"mean":null,"choice":"F","value":null},{"study_name":"Wang2020b","measurement_type":"ethnicity","group_count":"28","group_name":"all","max":null,"substance":null,"count":28,"calculation_type":"sample mean","group_parent_pk":null,"sd":null,"unit":null,"se":null,"min":null,"cv":null,"median":null,"group_pk":1304,"characteristica_pk":27426,"mean":null,"choice":"chinese","value":null},{"study_name":"Wang2020b","measurement_type":"age","group_count":"28","group_name":"all","max":26.5,"substance":null,"count":28,"calculation_type":"sample mean","group_parent_pk":null,"sd":null,"unit":"year","se":null,"min":22.5,"cv":null,"median":null,"group_pk":1304,"characteristica_pk":27427,"mean":24.4,"choice":null,"value":null},{"study_name":"Wang2020b","measurement_type":"bmi","group_count":"28","group_name":"all","max":35,"substance":null,"count":28,"calculation_type":"sample mean",